'''Eevee Grove''' (Japanese: '''{{j|イーブイガーデン}}''' ''Eievui Garden'') is the fifth themed booster pack in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]].

== Information ==
'''Eevee Grove''' is the fifth themed booster pack released through [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. The expansion focuses on {{p|Eevee}} and [[Eeveelution|its Evolutions]].

